From: cromite <cromite@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: Default "Request desktop site" for microsoftedge.microsoft.com

Keep the Microsoft Edge Add-ons domain using the desktop store UI by default
by allowing "Request desktop site" for microsoftedge.microsoft.com.

License: GPL-2.0-or-later - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-or-later.html
FILE:Support-Edge-Addons-store-extension-install.patch
---
diff --git a/components/content_settings/core/browser/host_content_settings_map.cc b/components/content_settings/core/browser/host_content_settings_map.cc
--- a/components/content_settings/core/browser/host_content_settings_map.cc
+++ b/components/content_settings/core/browser/host_content_settings_map.cc
@@ -332,6 +332,9 @@ HostContentSettingsMap::HostContentSettingsMap(PrefService* prefs,
   SetContentSettingDefaultScope(
     GURL("https://chromewebstore.google.com"), GURL(),
     ContentSettingsType::REQUEST_DESKTOP_SITE, CONTENT_SETTING_ALLOW);
+  SetContentSettingDefaultScope(
+    GURL("https://microsoftedge.microsoft.com"), GURL(),
+    ContentSettingsType::REQUEST_DESKTOP_SITE, CONTENT_SETTING_ALLOW);
 #endif
 
   const auto* registry =
-- 
